  "description": "Built on a relaxed and adventurous script style, Aethics Surfing features thick handwritten forms, smooth rounded contours, and a carefree, confident character across every line. The letters carry a fun, coastal nostalgic vibe, while clean flow and balanced proportions help your text pop effortlessly. It feels energetic and friendly rather than overwhelming, bringing an impressive, eye-catching tropical personality to any creative piece.\nIntroduce a touch of bold, joyful summer energy to your designs with Aethics Surfing, a vibrant script font meticulously crafted by Maulana Creative. Inspired by ocean breezes, retro beach aesthetics, and sunny outdoor culture, this font embodies the essence of “Loud & Heavy Creative Vibes“. Featuring smooth curves and extra-chunky script letterforms, Aethics Surfing is the perfect choice for striking logos, beachwear apparel, and bold poster designs.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Built on a relaxed and adventurous script style, Aethics Surfing features thick handwritten forms, smooth rounded contours, and a carefree, confident character across every line. The letters carry a fun, coastal nostalgic vibe, while clean flow and balanced proportions help your text pop effortlessly. It feels energetic and friendly rather than overwhelming, bringing an impressive, eye-catching tropical personality to any creative piece.</p>\n<p>Introduce a touch of bold, joyful summer energy to your designs with Aethics Surfing, a vibrant script font meticulously crafted by Maulana Creative. Inspired by ocean breezes, retro beach aesthetics, and sunny outdoor culture, this font embodies the essence of “Loud &amp; Heavy Creative Vibes“. Featuring smooth curves and extra-chunky script letterforms, Aethics Surfing is the perfect choice for striking logos, beachwear apparel, and bold poster designs.</p>",
